WEBVTT

00:08:29.163 --> 00:08:32.063
It will contain a signature, time stamp,

00:08:32.063 --> 00:08:34.197
and any rules around its resale.

00:08:35.363 --> 00:08:39.363
Once you’ve minted your work
and you want to sell it,

00:08:39.363 --> 00:08:40.997
you connect with your community

00:08:41.030 --> 00:08:44.397
and let them know
that your NFT has "dropped,"

00:08:44.397 --> 00:08:45.930
meaning it is for sale.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.963
It is important to note

00:08:48.963 --> 00:08:53.963
that all the same rules
that make for good art and business

00:08:53.997 --> 00:08:55.597
apply in the virtual world:

00:08:56.397 --> 00:08:59.997
a strong connection to your followers,